pecified BGP session in the \\*.pcap file.":"将指定 BGP 会话中保存的通告转储到 \\*.pcap 文件中。","docs-7.24\u0000List of BGP already established, not yet connected or disconnected sessions.":"已建立、尚未连接或已断开的 BGP 会话列表。","docs-7.24\u0000Resend prefixes to a specified BGP session. The command takes two arguments:":"向指定的 BGP 会话重新发送前缀。该命令接受两个参数：","docs-7.24\u0000Send route refresh to a specified BGP session. Is used to trigger re-sending all the routes from the remote peer.":"向指定 BGP 会话发送路由刷新。用于触发远端对等体重新发送所有路由。"}}
